PigProject/
├── students.txt        # Input file
├── pig_filter_script.pig   # Pig script


File:students.txt (Sample Input)

101,Raja,95
102,Pooja,85
103,Roja,75
104,Ram,65

File: pig_filter_script.pig

students = LOAD 'students.txt' USING PigStorage(',') 
           AS (rollno:int, name:chararray, mark:int);

high_scorers = FILTER students BY mark > 80;

DUMP high_scorers;

HDFS COMMANDS TO RUN:

hdfs dfs -mkdir /pigproject
hdfs dfs -put students.txt /pigproject

RUN PIG SCRIPT:
pig -x mapreduce pig_filter_script.pig